# ============================================================
# UNIT AUDIO TAG REFERENCE
# ============================================================
# This file documents the available audio tags used for unit
# equipment states. It exists only as a reference for the team.
#
# How to use:
# When defining an audio tag, write it in the format:
#
#    "UnitType_<TagName>"
#
# Example:
#    "UnitWeapon_sword"
#
# The tag should correspond to the equipment state used by
# the unit (armor, weapon, shield, etc.).
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# AVAILABLE AUDIO TAG STATES
# ------------------------------------------------------------


